---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

// Section ids match the previous site, so existing deep links keep working.
const toc = [
  { id: 'section1', label: '1. Overview' },
  { id: 'section2', label: '2. What Data We Collect' },
  { id: 'section3', label: '3. How We Use Data' },
  { id: 'section4', label: '4. Third-Party Processors' },
  { id: 'section5', label: '5. Retention & Deletion' },
  { id: 'section6', label: '6. Your Privacy Rights' },
  { id: 'section7', label: '7. Data Security' },
  { id: 'section8', label: "8. Children's Privacy" },
  { id: 'section9', label: '9. Changes & Contact' },
];
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Rehearse collects, uses and protects your data, and the choices you have."
  lead="What data we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, and the choices you have."
  toc={toc}
>
  <section id="section1">
    <h2>1. Overview & Our Commitment</h2>
    <p>
      We respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, and
      the choices you have regarding your information.
    </p>
    <p>We are committed to handling your data responsibly. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-title">Commitment</span>
      We've written this policy in plain English to ensure you understand exactly how your information is handled.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="section2">
    <h2>2. What Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information that you provide to us directly and information that is collected automatically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Account information (Name, Email,Username)</li>
      <li>Content you upload (Sheet music files, PDFs, or images)</li>
      <li>Communications you send to our support team</li>
      <li>Technical data (Device model, OS version, app usage logs)</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="section3">
    <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <p>We use your data to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Manage your account using Supabase Authentication</li>
      <li>Store and retrieve your files using Supabase Storage</li>
      <li>Process your uploaded sheet music to generate playable audio</li>
      <li>Respond to support requests and send service updates</li>
      <li>Improve app performance and detect security issues</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="section4">
    <h2>4. Third-Party Data Processors</h2>
    <p>We use trusted third-party providers to operate Rehearse:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Secured backend for database, storage, and authentication</li>
      {/* <li><strong>Apple and Google:</strong> Authentication infrastructure</li> */}
    </ul>
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="callout-title">Privacy First</span>
      We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to any third party for marketing purposes.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="section5">
    <h2>5. Data Retention & Account Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      We retain your personal data only as long as your account is active. You may delete individual files at any time.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Account Deletion:</strong> You can delete your account via App Settings. Upon deletion, all associated project
      data and profile information will be permanently removed from our systems within 30 days.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="section6">
    <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location, you may have the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal
      data.
    </p>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, please contact us at <strong><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></strong>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="section7">
    <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We implement commercially reasonable security measures (including encryption in transit and at rest via Supabase)
      to protect your data.
    </p>
    <p>However, as no method of transmission is 100% secure, we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="section8">
    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Rehearse is not intended for children under 13. If we discover we have collected data from a child under 13, we
      will delete it immediately.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="section9">
    <h2>9. Changes & Contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy periodically. Your continued use after updates constitutes acceptance.</p>
    <p>
      If you have questions, please contact us at <strong><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></strong>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Legal>
